  "common-default-rails/sine": "* quiz circuit\n* issue: kind_not_allowed Q1\n* issue: floating_pin C1.C\n* issue: floating_pin C1.B\n* issue: floating_pin M1.B\n* issue: floating_pin M1.E\n* issue: floating_pin D1.A\n* issue: floating_pin D1.K\n* issue: floating_pin R2.2\n* issue: unconnected_port in+\n* issue: unconnected_port out+\nQC1 n1 n2 n3 QPNP\nQM1 n3 n4 n5 QPNP\nD1 n6 n7 DZ_D1\nLR2 n3 n8 1e+1\n.model DZ_D1 D(IS=1e-14 BV=5.1e+0 IBV=1e-3)\n.model QPNP PNP(BF=100)\nVin in 0 SIN(5e-1 1e+0 1e+3)\nRload out outl 1e+12\nVmeas outl 0 0\n.tran 1e-5 5e-3 0\n.control\nset wr_vecnames\nset wr_singlescale\nrun\nlinearize v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\nwrdata /dev/stdout v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\n.endc\n.end\n",
  "common-default-rails/bare": "* quiz circuit\n* issue: kind_not_allowed Q1\n* issue: floating_pin C1.C\n* issue: floating_pin C1.B\n* issue: floating_pin M1.B\n* issue: floating_pin M1.E\n* issue: floating_pin D1.A\n* issue: floating_pin D1.K\n* issue: floating_pin R2.2\n* issue: unconnected_port in+\n* issue: unconnected_port out+\nQC1 n1 n2 n3 QPNP\nQM1 n3 n4 n5 QPNP\nD1 n6 n7 DZ_D1\nLR2 n3 n8 1e+1\n.model DZ_D1 D(IS=1e-14 BV=5.1e+0 IBV=1e-3)\n.model QPNP PNP(BF=100)\n.end\n",
  "split-dual-rails/step": "* quiz circuit\n* issue: floating_pin C1.C\n* issue: floating_pin C1.B\n* issue: floating_pin M1.B\n* issue: floating_pin M1.E\n* issue: floating_pin D1.A\n* issue: floating_pin D1.K\n* issue: floating_pin R2.2\n* issue: unconnected_port in+\n* issue: unconnected_port in-\n* issue: unconnected_port out+\n* issue: unconnected_port out-\n* issue: no_ground\nQC1 n1 n2 n3 QPNP\nQM1 n3 n4 n5 QPNP\nD1 n6 n7 DZ_D1\nLR2 n3 n8 1e+1\n.model DZ_D1 D(IS=1e-14 BV=5.1e+0 IBV=1e-3)\n.model QPNP PNP(BF=100)\nVcc vcc 0 DC 1.5e+1\nVee vee 0 DC -1.5e+1\nVin src inn PWL(0 0 1e-3 0 1.000001e-3 5e+0)\nRs src in 5e+1\nRload out outl 1e+4\nVmeas outl outn 0\n.tran 4.5e-5 1e-2 1e-3\n.control\nset wr_vecnames\nset wr_singlescale\nrun\nlinearize v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\nwrdata /dev/stdout v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\n.endc\n.end\n",
  "split-dual-rails/bare": "* quiz circuit\n* issue: floating_pin C1.C\n* issue: floating_pin C1.B\n* issue: floating_pin M1.B\n* issue: floating_pin M1.E\n* issue: floating_pin D1.A\n* issue: floating_pin D1.K\n* issue: floating_pin R2.2\n* issue: unconnected_port in+\n* issue: unconnected_port in-\n* issue: unconnected_port out+\n* issue: unconnected_port out-\n* issue: no_ground\nQC1 n1 n2 n3 QPNP\nQM1 n3 n4 n5 QPNP\nD1 n6 n7 DZ_D1\nLR2 n3 n8 1e+1\n.model DZ_D1 D(IS=1e-14 BV=5.1e+0 IBV=1e-3)\n.model QPNP PNP(BF=100)\n.end\n",
  "common-single-rail/pulse": "* quiz circuit\n* issue: kind_not_allowed Q1\n* issue: floating_pin C1.C\n* issue: floating_pin C1.B\n* issue: floating_pin M1.B\n* issue: floating_pin M1.E\n* issue: floating_pin D1.A\n* issue: floating_pin D1.K\n* issue: floating_pin R2.2\n* issue: unconnected_port in+\n* issue: unconnected_port out+\nQC1 n1 n2 n3 QPNP\nQM1 n3 n4 n5 QPNP\nD1 n6 n7 DZ_D1\nLR2 n3 n8 1e+1\n.model DZ_D1 D(IS=1e-14 BV=5.1e+0 IBV=1e-3)\n.model QPNP PNP(BF=100)\nVcc vcc 0 DC 5e+0\nVin in 0 PULSE(-1e+0 1e+0 0 1n 1n 5e-5 2e-4)\nCload out outl 1e-9\nVmeas outl 0 0\n.tran 1e-5 1e-3 0\n.control\nset wr_vecnames\nset wr_singlescale\nrun\nlinearize v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\nwrdata /dev/stdout v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\n.endc\n.end\n",
